{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The sky says nothing. Only those who keep flying were right.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aurora Flight is a realistic flight shooting game that aims for a balance between the accessibility of arcade-style gameplay and the depth of flight simulators, offering a new kind of aerial combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a physics-based model of lift and drag, aircraft performance reacts directly to pitch, speed, and altitude. Climb too steeply, and you'll lose speed. Turn too hard, and you'll stall. In this sky, your inputs are your tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Issue commands to allied wingmen\u2014spread out, concentrate fire, hold formation. If they take too much damage, they\u2019ll withdraw. You must read the situation and lead accordingly to seize control of the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighter customization allows free loadout choices, including missiles and optional modules. But power comes with trade-offs: score penalties, reduced mobility, and other risks that demand careful consideration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't a game where you simply fire missiles for flashy kills. You'll manage energy, avoid stalling, and maneuver for position behind the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no auto-aim. No scripted cutscenes.Only physics-based flight, tactical AI, loadout risk,\u2014and your judgment.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"F.I.F.T.H.\u767a\u52d5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3496950/9c8169045b85fa92b20828e7ff98962b2cb18342.jpg"},{"name":"\u5c01\u5370\u9818\u57df\u3078\u306e\u518d\u4fb5\u5165","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3496950/9c8169045b85fa92b20828e7ff98962b2cb18342.jpg"},{"name":"\u30c7\u30eb\u30bf\u968a\u8b77\u885b\u6210\u529f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3496950/9c